      <h3 id="resume-projects">Selected projects</h3>
      <dl>
        <div>
          <dt><a href="/work/soctukit/">SoctuKit</a></dt>
          <dd>
            Native Windows social-media automation app built with C#, .NET 8, WinUI 3, Windows App
            SDK, XAML, MVVM, tests, credential storage, and an installer.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt><a href="/work/uiu-discord-bot/">UIU Discord Bot</a></dt>
          <dd>
            Python and discord.py automation for UIU notices, duplicate prevention, automatic
            posting, calendar information, and Discord commands.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="resume-services">
      <h3 id="resume-services">Services</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Full-stack web development: frontend, backend, databases, APIs, and deployment</li>
        <li>Custom software: desktop tools, automation, integrations, and internal systems</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="resume-education">
      <h3 id="resume-education">Education</h3>
      <p>
        BSc in Computer Science and Engineering, in progress, United International University,
        Dhaka, Bangladesh.
      </p>
    </section>
